            ("p", "Skip the machines for the first session and spend twenty minutes on the cardio equipment at an easy pace. Not for fitness — for familiarity. You are learning where things are, how the entry gates work, and what the room feels like. Then do three simple movements: a goblet squat, a push-up or chest press, and a row."),
