            ("p", "Most machines have a diagram showing the movement and the muscles, an adjustable seat with a pin, and a weight stack with a pin. Adjust the seat so the joint you are working lines up with the machine's pivot — if you are not sure, the diagram will show it. Start at the lightest plate and do one set there. Nobody is timing you."),
